<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 48-1 IN 1ST INNINGS V ZIMBABWE (376) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 48-1 IN 1ST INNINGS V ZIMBABWE (376) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, replying to</p>
<p>Zimbabwe's first innings total of 376, were 48 for one at the</p>
<p>close on the second day of the first test at Queen's Club on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p>Rain prevented any play after the tea interval.</p>
</text>
